PaymentRailsFactory_CreateDeterministic
├── when caller is not the factory owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
├── when owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with PaymentRailsFactory_ZeroOwner
├── when owner is valid address
│   ├── it should deploy a new PaymentRails contract
│   ├── it should set the owner on the deployed PaymentRails
│   ├── it should deploy to the predicted address
│   ├── it should register the instance in the factory
│   ├── it should emit a PaymentRailsCreated event
│   └── when same salt is reused with same owner
│       └── it should revert
├── when different salts are used with the same owner
│   └── it should deploy to different addresses
└── when same salt is used with different owners
    └── it should deploy to different addresses
